# The Deliberative Process: An Analysis from Three Perspectives.

**Authors:** Atkins, Elaine

## Abstract
In 1984, Community College of Philadelphia received a $250,000 Ford Foundation grant to design and implement a transfer curriculum for predominantly poor, minority students. This paper describes the humanities faculty's team efforts to model a vital intellectual community for students by revamping curriculum approaches, value frameworks, and language systems. (7 references) (MLH)

